window.locales={fr:{"meta.title":"Église Orthodoxe Russe Saint Alexandre Nevsky à Pau","meta.description":"Liturgie byzantine à Pau, horaires des offices, événements, services et histoire de l’église. Un lieu d’accueil et de prière, ouvert à tous, pour partager la foi, la culture orthodoxe et soutenir nos projets.","brand.name":"Nevsky","nav.home":"Accueil","nav.about":"Histoire","nav.services":"Services","nav.events":"Événements","nav.catechism":"Catéchisme","nav.catechism.href":"catechisme-orthodoxe.html","nav.donate":"Dons","nav.contact":"Contact","nav.cta":"Faire un don","hero.title":"Lumière et paix au cœur du Béarn","hero.desc":"Venez vivre la beauté de la liturgie orthodoxe dans notre église Saint Alexandre Nevsky à Pau. Un lieu de prière, de rencontre et de partage de la foi, la tradition byzantine et l’amitié chrétienne.","hero.cta1":"Prochains offices","hero.cta2":"Soutenir l'église","about.title":"Histoire de notre église","about.p1":"Fondée en 1867 à l’initiative du père Hérodien, aumônier de la colonie russe, l’église Saint‑Alexandre‑Nevsky vit le jour grâce à une souscription de 65 000 francs levée auprès des aristocrates russes du Béarn. Troisième église orthodoxe russe bâtie en France, après Nice (1860) et Paris (1861), elle est dédiée à Alexandre Nevsky, prince de Novgorod et héros de la bataille de la Neva (1240). Elle illustre les liens profonds unissant Pau et la Russie.","about.p2":"Discrète, nichée dans un jardin bordé de palmiers, elle ne possède ni dômes traditionnels ni façades ostentatoires. Commandée depuis Saint Petersbourg à un architecte palois, qui en lieu et place d’une église orthodoxe a livré une construction semblable aux églises protestantes construites pour les résidents anglophones dans le quartier actuel du commissariat.","about.cards.history.title":"Un patrimoine depuis 1867","about.cards.history.text":"Troisième église orthodoxe russe bâtie en France, après Nice et Paris, elle témoigne depuis plus de 150 ans des liens entre Pau et la Russie.","about.cards.history.link":"Nous rendre visite →","about.cards.trad.title":"Tradition vivante","about.cards.trad.text":"La Divine Liturgie est célébrée en slavon, parfois aussi en français, avec le chant a cappella, les icônes et le calendrier julien de l’Église russe.","about.cards.trad.link":"Comment se passe un office →","about.cards.trad.href":"premiere-visite.html","about.cards.comm.title":"Communauté","about.cards.comm.text":"Français orthodoxes et russophones des pays de l’ex-URSS se retrouvent après la Liturgie autour d’un repas pour discuter. Croyants ou simples curieux, vous êtes les bienvenus.","about.cards.comm.link":"Recevoir les nouvelles de la paroisse →","services.title":"Services proposés","services.desc":"Accompagnement spirituel et sacrements dans la tradition orthodoxe.","services.items.bapt.title":"Baptême","services.items.bapt.text":"Préparation au baptême des enfants et des adultes, selon le rite byzantin.","services.items.mar.title":"Mariage","services.items.mar.text":"Accompagnement des fiancés et célébration du sacrement du mariage.","services.items.conf.title":"Confession & accompagnement","services.items.conf.text":"Rencontre avec le prêtre pour la confession, l'écoute et la prière.","services.items.cat.title":"Catéchisme","services.items.cat.text":"Cours pour enfants, adolescents et adultes, introduction à la foi orthodoxe.","services.items.ben.title":"Bénédictions & funérailles","services.items.ben.text":"Bénédiction des maisons et objets, prière pour les malades, funérailles.","services.items.hor.title":"Horaires des offices","services.items.hor.text":"Consultez ci-dessous le calendrier des offices et des fêtes liturgiques.","services.contact":"Prendre rendez-vous avec le prêtre →","services.items.bapt.link":"Tout savoir sur le baptême →","services.items.bapt.href":"bapteme.html","services.items.mar.link":"Tout savoir sur le mariage →","services.items.mar.href":"mariage.html","services.items.conf.link":"Comment se confesser ? →","services.items.conf.href":"confession.html","services.items.cat.link":"Les cours de catéchisme →","services.items.cat.href":"cours-de-catechisme.html","services.items.ben.link":"Bénédictions, malades et funérailles →","services.items.ben.href":"benedictions-et-funerailles.html","services.items.hor.link":"Voir le calendrier →","services.items.hor.href":"#events","nav.lectures":"Lectures","nav.lectures.href":"lectures-spirituelles.html","lectures.all":"Toutes les lectures spirituelles →","lectures.title":"Lectures spirituelles","lectures.desc":"Des grands livres de la tradition, des vies de saints et des articles sur la foi et la prière, présentés simplement pour les découvrir ou les approfondir.","verse.title":"Citation biblique du jour","verse.fallback.text":"« Car Dieu a tant aimé le monde qu’il a donné son Fils unique, afin que quiconque croit en lui ne périsse point, mais qu’il ait la vie éternelle. »","verse.fallback.ref":"Jean 3, 16","verse.version":"Bible Louis Segond 1910","lectures.latest":"Dernières lectures","about.patron":"Découvrir saint Alexandre Nevsky, notre saint patron →","about.patron.href":"saint-alexandre-nevsky.html","events.firstvisit":"Première visite ? Ce qu’il faut savoir →","events.firstvisit.href":"premiere-visite.html","events.title":"Événements à venir & calendrier des offices","events.desc":"Voici les prochains événements de la paroisse. Vous pouvez ajouter les dates à votre agenda.","events.add":"Ajouter au calendrier","events.item1.title":"Divine Liturgie de la Dormition","events.item1.time":"Vendredi 28 août · 10:00 — 12:00","events.item1.desc":"Grande fête mariale. Office suivi d'un temps fraternel.","events.item2.title":"Vêpres","events.item2.time":"Samedi 23 août · 18:30 — 19:30","events.item2.desc":"Office du soir avec chant choral.","events.item3.title":"Catéchisme adultes","events.item3.time":"Dimanche 31 août · 12:15 — 13:15","events.item3.desc":"Découverte de la foi orthodoxe, questions & réponses.","events.help":"Cliquez sur une date pour voir les fêtes, le jeûne et les offices.","events.notice.title":"Église temporairement fermée pour travaux","events.notice.text":"Merci de votre compréhension. Inscrivez-vous à la newsletter pour être informé(e) de la réouverture et des prochains offices.","don.title":"Soutenir les grands travaux","don.desc":"Notre église nécessite des travaux importants (toiture, chauffage, mise aux normes). Votre don nous aide à préserver ce lieu de prière.","don.goal":"Objectif : 50 000 €","don.helloasso":"Don via HelloAsso","don.once":"Don unique","don.monthly":"Don mensuel","don.alloc":"Affectation des dons","don.items.roof":"Toiture et isolation","don.items.heat":"Chauffage & électricité","don.items.access":"Accessibilité & sécurité","don.items.icons":"Entretien des icônes","news.title":"Inscription à la newsletter","news.desc":"Recevez les annonces de la paroisse, les horaires des offices et les événements.","news.cta":"S'inscrire","news.legal":"Nous ne partagerons jamais votre e‑mail.","contact.title":"Contact","contact.addr":"Adresse : 18 Rue Jean Réveil, 64000 Pau, France","contact.phoneL":"Téléphone","contact.priestL":"Prêtre","contact.priest":"Père Alexandre","contact.form.nameL":"Nom","contact.form.emailL":"E‑mail","contact.form.msgL":"Message","contact.form.send":"Envoyer","contact.form.wait":"Envoi en cours...","contact.form.success":"Message envoyé. Merci !","contact.form.error":"Une erreur est survenue.","footer.rights":"Tous droits réservés.","footer.links":"Liens utiles","footer.socials":"Réseaux sociaux"},ru:{"meta.title":"Русская Православная Церковь Святого Александра Невского в По","meta.description":"Византийская литургия в По, расписание богослужений, события, история храма. Место молитвы и встречи, открытое для всех, кто ищет веру и общение.","brand.name":"Невский","nav.home":"Главная","nav.about":"История","nav.services":"Служения","nav.events":"События","nav.catechism":"Закон Божий","nav.catechism.href":"zakon-bozhij.html","nav.donate":"Пожертвования","nav.contact":"Контакты","nav.cta":"Сделать пожертвование","hero.title":"Свет и мир в сердце Беарна","hero.desc":"Приходите насладиться красотой православной литургии в нашем храме Святого Александра Невского в По. Это место молитвы, встреч и обмена верой, византийскими традициями и христианской дружбой.","hero.cta1":"Ближайшие богослужения","hero.cta2":"Поддержать храм","about.title":"Наш приход","about.p1":"Основанный в 1867 году по инициативе отца Иродиана, капеллана русской колонии, храм святого Александра Невского был воздвигнут на средства подписки в размере 65 000 франков, собранных среди русской аристократии Беарна. Это третий русский православный храм, построенный во Франции после Ниццы (1860) и Парижа (1861). Он посвящён Александру Невскому, новгородскому князю и герою Невской битвы (1240), и свидетельствует о глубоких связях между По и Россией.","about.p2":"Скромная, расположенная в саду, окруженном пальмами, она не имеет ни традиционных куполов, ни показных фасадов. Её заказали в Санкт-Петербурге архитектору из По, который вместо православной церкви построил здание, похожее на протестантские церкви, построенные для англоговорящих жителей в районе нынешнего полицейского участка.","about.cards.history.title":"Наследие с 1867 года","about.cards.history.text":"Третий русский православный храм, построенный во Франции после Ниццы и Парижа, более 150 лет свидетельствует о связях По и России.","about.cards.history.link":"Как нас найти →","about.cards.trad.title":"Живая традиция","about.cards.trad.text":"Божественная литургия совершается на церковнославянском языке, иногда и на французском: хоровое пение без инструментов, иконы и юлианский календарь Русской Церкви.","about.cards.trad.link":"Как проходит богослужение →","about.cards.trad.href":"pervoe-poseshchenie.html","about.cards.comm.title":"Община","about.cards.comm.text":"Православные французы и русскоязычные выходцы из стран бывшего СССР после литургии собираются за общей трапезой. Верующим и просто интересующимся — добро пожаловать!","about.cards.comm.link":"Подписаться на новости прихода →","services.title":"Наши служения","services.desc":"Духовное сопровождение и таинства в православной традиции.","services.items.bapt.title":"Крещение","services.items.bapt.text":"Подготовка к крещению детей и взрослых по византийскому чину.","services.items.mar.title":"Венчание","services.items.mar.text":"Подготовка женихов и невест, совершение таинства брака.","services.items.conf.title":"Исповедь и беседа","services.items.conf.text":"Встреча со священником для исповеди, беседы и молитвы.","services.items.cat.title":"Катехизация","services.items.cat.text":"Занятия для детей, подростков и взрослых. Введение в веру.","services.items.ben.title":"Освящения и отпевание","services.items.ben.text":"Освящение домов и вещей, молитва о больных, отпевание.","services.items.hor.title":"Расписание служб","services.items.hor.text":"Ниже — календарь богослужений и праздников.","services.contact":"Записаться на встречу со священником →","services.items.bapt.link":"Всё о Таинстве Крещения →","services.items.bapt.href":"kreshchenie.html","services.items.mar.link":"Всё о Таинстве Венчания →","services.items.mar.href":"venchanie.html","services.items.conf.link":"Как исповедоваться? →","services.items.conf.href":"ispoved.html","services.items.cat.link":"Занятия по катехизации →","services.items.cat.href":"katehizacija.html","services.items.ben.link":"Освящения, болящие и отпевание →","services.items.ben.href":"treby.html","services.items.hor.link":"Смотреть календарь →","services.items.hor.href":"#events","nav.lectures":"Чтение","nav.lectures.href":"duhovnoe-chtenie.html","lectures.all":"Всё духовное чтение →","lectures.title":"Духовное чтение","lectures.desc":"Книги святых отцов, жития святых и статьи о вере и молитве. Коротко о главном, чтобы открыть их для себя или узнать больше.","verse.title":"Цитата из Библии на сегодня","verse.fallback.text":"«Ибо так возлюбил Бог мир, что отдал Сына Своего Единородного, дабы всякий верующий в Него не погиб, но имел жизнь вечную.»","verse.fallback.ref":"Ин. 3:16","verse.version":"Синодальный перевод","lectures.latest":"Новое","about.patron":"Святой Александр Невский — небесный покровитель нашего храма →","about.patron.href":"aleksandr-nevskij.html","events.firstvisit":"Впервые в храме? Что полезно знать →","events.firstvisit.href":"pervoe-poseshchenie.html","events.title":"Ближайшие события и календарь служб","events.desc":"Здесь вы найдёте ближайшие события прихода. Добавляйте даты в свой календарь.","events.add":"Добавить в календарь","events.item1.title":"Божественная Литургия Успения","events.item1.time":"Пятница 28 августа · 10:00 — 12:00","events.item1.desc":"Великий богородичный праздник. После — братское чаепитие.","events.item2.title":"Вечерня","events.item2.time":"Суббота 23 августа · 18:30 — 19:30","events.item2.desc":"Вечернее богослужение с хоровым пением.","events.item3.title":"Катехизация для взрослых","events.item3.time":"Воскресенье 31 августа · 12:15 — 13:15","events.item3.desc":"Знакомство с православной верой. Вопросы и ответы.","events.help":"Нажмите на дату, чтобы увидеть праздники, пост и богослужения.","events.notice.title":"Храм временно закрыт на ремонт","events.notice.text":"Спасибо за понимание. Подпишитесь на рассылку, чтобы получить уведомление об открытии и ближайших богослужениях.","don.title":"Поддержите ремонт храма","don.desc":"Храм нуждается в серьёзных работах (крыша, отопление, безопасность). Ваше пожертвование помогает сохранить дом молитвы.","don.goal":"Цель: 50 000 €","don.helloasso":"Пожертвовать через HelloAsso","don.once":"Разовое пожертвование","don.monthly":"Ежемесячно","don.alloc":"На что идут пожертвования","don.items.roof":"Крыша и утепление","don.items.heat":"Отопление и электрика","don.items.access":"Доступность и безопасность","don.items.icons":"Уход за иконами","news.title":"Подписка на новости","news.desc":"Получайте объявления прихода, расписание служб и события.","news.cta":"Подписаться","news.legal":"Мы никогда не передаём ваш e‑mail третьим лицам.","contact.title":"Контакты","contact.addr":"Адрес: 18 Rue Jean Réveil, 64000 Pau, France","contact.phoneL":"Телефон","contact.priestL":"Священник","contact.priest":"Отец Александр","contact.form.nameL":"Имя","contact.form.emailL":"Электронная почта","contact.form.msgL":"Сообщение","contact.form.send":"Отправить","contact.form.wait":"Отправка...","contact.form.success":"Сообщение отправлено. Спасибо !","contact.form.error":"Произошла ошибка.","footer.rights":"Все права защищены.","footer.links":"Полезные ссылки","footer.socials":"Социальные сети"},en:{"meta.title":"Russian Orthodox Church of Saint Alexander Nevsky in Pau","meta.description":"Byzantine liturgy in Pau, service times, events, and church history. A place of prayer and fellowship, open to all seeking faith and community.","brand.name":"Nevsky","nav.home":"Home","nav.about":"History","nav.services":"Services","nav.events":"Events","nav.catechism":"Catechism","nav.catechism.href":"orthodox-catechism.html","nav.donate":"Donate","nav.contact":"Contact","nav.cta":"Make a Donation","hero.title":"Light and Peace in the Heart of Béarn","hero.desc":"Join us for the beauty of Orthodox liturgy at our Saint Alexander Nevsky Church in Pau. A place of prayer, fellowship, and sharing faith, Byzantine traditions, and Christian friendship.","hero.cta1":"Upcoming Services","hero.cta2":"Support the Church","about.title":"Our Parish","about.p1":"Founded in 1867 by Father Herodian, chaplain of the Russian colony, the Saint Alexander Nevsky Church was built through a fundraising campaign that raised 65,000 francs from the Russian aristocracy of Béarn. It is the third Russian Orthodox church built in France, after Nice (1860) and Paris (1861). Dedicated to Alexander Nevsky, the prince of Novgorod and hero of the Battle of the Neva (1240), it reflects the deep ties between Pau and Russia.","about.p2":"Humble and nestled in a garden surrounded by palm trees, it lacks traditional domes and ostentatious facades. Commissioned from a Pau architect in Saint Petersburg, it resembles a Protestant church built for English-speaking residents in the area of the current police station.","about.cards.history.title":"A heritage since 1867","about.cards.history.text":"The third Russian Orthodox church built in France, after Nice and Paris, it has borne witness to the ties between Pau and Russia for over 150 years.","about.cards.history.link":"Visit us →","about.cards.trad.title":"Living tradition","about.cards.trad.text":"The Divine Liturgy is celebrated in Church Slavonic, sometimes also in French, with a cappella singing, icons and the Julian calendar of the Russian Church.","about.cards.trad.link":"What happens at a service →","about.cards.trad.href":"first-visit.html","about.cards.comm.title":"Community","about.cards.comm.text":"French Orthodox Christians and Russian speakers from the former Soviet Union gather after the Liturgy for a shared meal. Believers and the simply curious are all welcome.","about.cards.comm.link":"Get the parish news →","services.title":"Our Services","services.desc":"Spiritual guidance and sacraments in the Orthodox tradition.","services.items.bapt.title":"Baptism","services.items.bapt.text":"Preparation for the baptism of children and adults according to the Byzantine rite.","services.items.mar.title":"Marriage","services.items.mar.text":"Preparation for couples and celebration of the sacrament of marriage.","services.items.conf.title":"Confession & Guidance","services.items.conf.text":"Meet with the priest for confession, listening, and prayer.","services.items.cat.title":"Catechism","services.items.cat.text":"Classes for children, teenagers, and adults. Introduction to the faith.","services.items.ben.title":"Blessings & Funerals","services.items.ben.text":"Blessing of homes and objects, prayer for the sick, funerals.","services.items.hor.title":"Service Times","services.items.hor.text":"Below is the calendar of services and liturgical feasts.","services.contact":"Make an appointment with the priest →","services.items.bapt.link":"All about baptism →","services.items.bapt.href":"baptism.html","services.items.mar.link":"All about marriage →","services.items.mar.href":"orthodox-wedding.html","services.items.conf.link":"How to go to confession →","services.items.conf.href":"holy-confession.html","services.items.cat.link":"Catechism classes →","services.items.cat.href":"catechism-classes.html","services.items.ben.link":"Blessings, the sick and funerals →","services.items.ben.href":"blessings-and-funerals.html","services.items.hor.link":"See the calendar →","services.items.hor.href":"#events","nav.lectures":"Reading","nav.lectures.href":"spiritual-reading.html","lectures.all":"All spiritual reading →","lectures.title":"Spiritual reading","lectures.desc":"Classic books of the tradition, lives of the saints and articles on faith and prayer, presented simply so you can discover them or go deeper.","verse.title":"Bible verse of the day","verse.fallback.text":"“For God so loved the world, that he gave his only begotten Son, that whosoever believeth in him should not perish, but have everlasting life.”","verse.fallback.ref":"John 3:16","verse.version":"King James Version","lectures.latest":"Latest reading","about.patron":"Discover Saint Alexander Nevsky, our patron saint →","about.patron.href":"alexander-nevsky.html","events.firstvisit":"First visit? What to know →","events.firstvisit.href":"first-visit.html","events.title":"Upcoming Events & Service Calendar","events.desc":"Here are the upcoming events of the parish. You can add the dates to your calendar.","events.add":"Add to Calendar","events.item1.title":"Divine Liturgy of the Dormition","events.item1.time":"Friday, August 28 · 10:00 — 12:00","events.item1.desc":"Great Marian feast. Followed by a time of fellowship.","events.item2.title":"Vespers","events.item2.time":"Saturday, August 23 · 18:30 — 19:30","events.item2.desc":"Evening service with choral singing.","events.item3.title":"Adult Catechism","events.item3.time":"Sunday, August 31 · 12:15 — 13:15","events.item3.desc":"Introduction to the Orthodox faith, questions & answers.","events.help":"Click on a date to see feasts, fasting and services.","events.notice.title":"Church temporarily closed for renovation","events.notice.text":"Thank you for your understanding. Subscribe to the newsletter to be notified about the reopening and upcoming services.","don.title":"Support Major Works","don.desc":"Our church requires significant repairs (roof, heating, safety). Your donation helps preserve this place of prayer.","don.goal":"Goal: 50,000 €","don.helloasso":"Donate via HelloAsso","don.once":"One-time Donation","don.monthly":"Monthly Donation","don.alloc":"Allocation of Donations","don.items.roof":"Roof and Insulation","don.items.heat":"Heating & Electricity","don.items.access":"Accessibility & Safety","don.items.icons":"Icon Maintenance","news.title":"Newsletter Subscription","news.desc":"Receive parish announcements, service times, and events.","news.cta":"Subscribe","news.legal":"We will never share your email.","contact.title":"Contact","contact.addr":"Address: 18 Rue Jean Réveil, 64000 Pau, France","contact.phoneL":"Phone","contact.priestL":"Priest","contact.priest":"Father Alexandre","contact.form.nameL":"Name","contact.form.emailL":"Email","contact.form.msgL":"Message","contact.form.send":"Send","contact.form.wait":"Sending...","contact.form.success":"Message sent. Thank you!","contact.form.error":"An error occurred.","footer.rights":"All rights reserved.","footer.links":"Useful Links","footer.socials":"Social Media"}};